lies under Cartel control.","conflict":"The Wardens will not release scarce cable without proof, and Veya's charts are the only proof. Kael arrives and demands the charts in return for passage, while open flame near the forge-pits endangers the isle.","outcome":"A spark from an unshielded lantern nearly severs a cable. Kael and Veya together smother it, shaking Kael's certainty, but the Wardens still demand Veya share her findings openly.","depends_on":["scn_the_toll_masters_offer"]},{"id":"scn_the_silverspine_council","title":"The Silverspine Council","summary":"Back at the academy, Veya faces the Wardens and scholars. She must admit her mentor's theory is wrong in part, that the isles are not simply drifting but being undermined from below, or lose their support.","location_id":"loc_silverspine","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya wants the Wardens to commit to a descent into the roots, and Maris wants a guarantee that The Hollow will be protected from the levy.","conflict":"Veya's inability to admit error stalls the council until Maris, torn between home and friendship, speaks for her. The scholars doubt a miller's daughter's testimony.","outcome":"Veya admits her error and shares the full chart. The council agrees to send an expedition, but word reaches Kael, who moves to seize the roots first.","depends_on":["scn_forge_fires_and_sabotage"]}]},{"id":"act_climax","title":"The Hollow Calm","purpose":"climax","scenes":[{"id":"scn_race_to_the_roots","title":"Race to the Roots","summary":"Kael leads Cartel enforcers to the roots to claim the last stable routes, while Veya and Maris take the expedition through Maris's corridors ahead of him. The two groups meet in the dark above the gnawed chamber.","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya wants to chart and reinforce a safe route, and Kael wants to seize the roots and the bridges above them.","conflict":"The two sides stand over a chamber where the cloudstone is breaking apart, and neither can claim the route without the other's knowledge: Veya's charts and Kael's ledger-mastery of the Cartel's resources.","outcome":"The thing in the roots stirs and the floor begins to give way, trapping Kael's enforcers and forcing both sides to act together.","depends_on":["scn_the_silverspine_council"]},{"id":"scn_the_breath_beneath","title":"The Breath Beneath","summary":"In the windless dark, the ancient thing slides through the roots and gnaws the last stable cables. Veya uses her charts to guide the group along the weakest points, Maris leads them through the corridors, and Kael spends Cartel cable and goods freely to brace the span.","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya wants to save the group and the last bridges, and Kael wants to hold the routes at any cost.","conflict":"Kael's instinct to price every sacrifice nearly costs them the span, and Veya must trust his resources and Maris her rival's word to get everyone out.","outcome":"A faint draught stirs and the creature recoils from the moving air. The group braces the span with Cartel cable and escapes, with the bridge held but badly strained.","depends_on":["scn_race_to_the_roots"]}]},{"id":"act_resolution","title":"After the Calm","purpose":"resolution","scenes":[{"id":"scn_the_wind_returns","title":"The Wind Returns","summary":"As the wind returns across The Hollow, windmills turn again. Kael, shaken, surrenders the cable stores and the levy on the grain to the Wardens and the Hollow Circle, having learned what control cost him.","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_kael","chr_maris","chr_veya"],"goal":"Kael wants to atone without losing the Cartel entirely, and Maris wants the levy lifted.","conflict":"Maris does not forgive easily and the Hollow Circle doubts a toll-master's change of heart.","outcome":"Kael lifts the levy and opens the cable stores, and Maris accepts the grain shipments openly, no longer smuggling.","depends_on":["scn_the_breath_beneath"]},{"id":"scn_charts_shared","title":"Charts Shared","summary":"At Silverspine, Veya copies her charts and distributes them to the Wardens, Kael, and the Hollow Circle, replacing her mentor's theory with the truth about the roots and promising a joint watch on the skybridges.","location_id":"loc_silverspine","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_maris","chr_kael"],"goal":"Veya wants the charts shared so no one can bury or hoard them.","conflict":"Some scholars resent the revision of her mentor's work, and Kael hesitates to give up the Cartel's advantage in tolls.","outcome":"Kael agrees to a shared toll and watch, ending the toll war for now. Veya accepts that truths shared are safer, and Maris takes a place on the watch.","depends_on":["scn_the_wind_returns"]},{"id":"scn_a_season_of_wind","title":"A Season of Wind","summary":"At Mistral Docks, ships depart on the returning wind and wind-debt is repaid in labour at the bridge repairs. A quiet watch is posted at the roots, and the sound of something distant still lingers in the corridors.","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_kael","chr_veya"],"goal":"Kael wants to rebuild trade on fairer terms, and Veya wants to confirm the watch is manned.","conflict":"Cartel merchants resent the lowered tolls, and Veya's charts show the roots still pulse faintly.","outcome":"Kael backs the new terms against his own merchants and Veya leaves to continue charting, aware that the thing below has only withdrawn.","depends_on":["scn_charts_shared"]}]}]}
