the cloudstone is breaking apart, and neither can claim the route without the other's knowledge: Veya's charts and Kael's ledger-mastery of the Cartel's resources.","outcome":"The thing in the roots stirs and the floor begins to give way, trapping Kael's enforcers and forcing both sides to act together.","depends_on":["scn_the_silverspine_council"]},{"id":"scn_the_breath_beneath","title":"The Breath Beneath","summary":"In the windless dark, the ancient thing slides through the roots and gnaws the last stable cables. Veya uses her charts to guide the group along the weakest points, Maris leads them through the corridors, and Kael spends Cartel cable and goods freely to brace the span.","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya wants to save the group and the last bridges, and Kael wants to hold the routes at any cost.","conflict":"Kael's instinct to price every sacrifice nearly costs them the span, and Veya must trust his resources and Maris her rival's word to get everyone out.","outcome":"A faint draught stirs and the creature recoils from the moving air. The group braces the span with Cartel cable and escapes, with the bridge held but badly strained.","depends_on":["scn_race_to_the_roots"]}]},{"id":"act_resolution","title":"After the Calm","purpose":"resolution","scenes":[{"id":"scn_the_wind_returns","title":"The Wind Returns","summary":"As the wind returns across The Hollow, windmills turn again. Kael, shaken, surrenders the cable stores and the levy on the grain to the Wardens and the Hollow Circle, having learned what control cost him.","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_kael","chr_maris","chr_veya"],"goal":"Kael wants to atone without losing the Cartel entirely, and Maris wants the levy lifted.","conflict":"Maris does not forgive easily and the Hollow Circle doubts a toll-master's change of heart.","outcome":"Kael lifts the levy and opens the cable stores, and Maris accepts the grain shipments openly, no longer smuggling.","depends_on":["scn_the_breath_beneath"]},{"id":"scn_charts_shared","title":"Charts Shared","summary":"At Silverspine, Veya copies her charts and distributes them to the Wardens, Kael, and the Hollow Circle, replacing her mentor's theory with the truth about the roots and promising a joint watch on the skybridges.","location_id":"loc_silverspine","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_maris","chr_kael"],"goal":"Veya wants the charts shared so no one can bury or hoard them.","conflict":"Some scholars resent the revision of her mentor's work, and Kael hesitates to give up the Cartel's advantage in tolls.","outcome":"Kael agrees to a shared toll and watch, ending the toll war for now. Veya accepts that truths shared are safer, and Maris takes a place on the watch.","depends_on":["scn_the_wind_returns"]},{"id":"scn_a_season_of_wind","title":"A Season of Wind","summary":"At Mistral Docks, ships depart on the returning wind and wind-debt is repaid in labour at the bridge repairs. A quiet watch is posted at the roots, and the sound of something distant still lingers in the corridors.","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_kael","chr_veya"],"goal":"Kael wants to rebuild trade on fairer terms, and Veya wants to confirm the watch is manned.","conflict":"Cartel merchants resent the lowered tolls, and Veya's charts show the roots still pulse faintly.","outcome":"Kael backs the new terms against his own merchants and Veya leaves to continue charting, aware that the thing below has only withdrawn.","depends_on":["scn_charts_shared"]}]}]}
