ights to her charts. She remembers they were apprentices together and refuses.","location_id":"loc_silverspine","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael"],"goal":"Kael wants the charts. Veya wants to keep them out of Cartel hands.","conflict":"Veya wants recognition but fears becoming like the Cartel leaders. Kael's offer is tempting, and she is too stubborn to say so.","outcome":"Veya refuses and Kael leaves with a veiled warning. She decides to protect her charts by leaving for the lower isles.","depends_on":["scn_kael_at_the_docks"]}]},{"id":"act_rising","title":"Closing Currents","purpose":"rising_action","scenes":[{"id":"scn_the_hollows_secret_paths","title":"The Hollow's Secret Paths","summary":"Veya reaches The Hollow and meets Maris, who is smuggling grain to dodge the Cartel levy. They agree to trade wind-current knowledge for Maris's unmapped service corridors.","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya wants to find a hidden route that avoids Cartel watchers. Maris wants to keep The Hollow fed.","conflict":"Maris trusts slowly and suspects Veya will draw the Cartel to her silos. Veya is reluctant to share her unfinished work.","outcome":"They form a cautious alliance and Maris shows Veya the corridors between the windmills and granaries.","depends_on":["scn_the_request_refused"]},{"id":"scn_the_levy_enforcers","title":"The Levy Enforcers","summary":"Cartel enforcers close in on Maris's smuggling routes at The Hollow. Veya's wind-sight and Maris's corridors let them slip away with only part of the grain.","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_maris"],"goal":"Get the grain shipment out past the enforcers.","conflict":"The enforcers follow the trail that Veya's open use of her charts left behind. Maris must choose between loyalty to home and her new friendship.","outcome":"The grain gets through and The Hollow is safe for now, but Maris learns that Veya's carelessness exposed her routes.","depends_on":["scn_the_hollows_secret_paths"]},{"id":"scn_forge_island_sabotage","title":"Cables at Emberroost","summary":"Veya and Maris travel to Emberroost to warn the Bridge Wardens that a key cloudstone cable is failing. Kael arrives, and each side blames the other for the damaged supplies.","location_id":"loc_emberroost","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_maris","chr_kael"],"goal":"Veya wants the Wardens to act on her charts. Kael wants control of the surviving routes.","conflict":"Veya refuses to admit her charts are incomplete when the Wardens ask about the new pressure front. Kael uses her silence to suggest the Wardens are unreliable.","outcome":"The Wardens delay action, and Kael leaves with a promise to expose Veya as a fraud if the cable fails.","depends_on":["scn_the_levy_enforcers"]},{"id":"scn_the_unreadable_front","title":"The Unreadable Front","summary":"A new storm forms over the archipelago. Veya tries to read it and her wind-sight fails. She finally admits to Maris that her gift has limits.","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_maris"],"goal":"Predict the storm's path and warn the isles before it hits.","conflict":"The storm moves unlike any current she knows. Her flaw has already cost her the time she needed.","outcome":"Veya admits her limit and Maris proposes pooling everyone's knowledge, including the Cartel's shipping records and the Wardens' cable surveys.","depends_on":["scn_forge_island_sabotage"]},{"id":"scn_kaels_gambit","title":"Kael's Gambit","summary":"As the storm closes in, Kael moves to close the toll gates at Mistral Docks and claim the last stable bridges for the Cartel. Veya confronts him with the truth about the storm.","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael","chr_maris"],"goal":"Kael wants to lock down the stable routes. Veya wants him to open the lanes for a shared plan.","conflict":"Kael believes control is the only protection and equates price with worth. Veya must 