ol","summary":"As the bridge under the Cartel's enforcers frays, Kael has the chance to cut them loose and keep the route for himself. He sees that his hold on the route would cost lives and lets Veya's shared chart guide his people to safety.","location_id":"loc_silverspine","character_ids":["chr_kael","chr_veya"],"goal":"Kael wants to save his enforcers and keep the route; Veya wants to bring everyone across.","conflict":"Kael's belief that price equals worth clashes with Veya's openness, and his admiration for her skill collides with his need to win.","outcome":"Kael yields the route, helping Veya guide the crossing, and the Cartel's monopoly on the last stable bridge is broken.","depends_on":["scn_crossing_the_last_bridge"]}]},{"id":"act_resolution","title":"Charts Shared","purpose":"resolution","scenes":[{"id":"scn_burning_the_margin","title":"Burning the Margin","summary":"At Emberroost, in a shielded forge-pit that keeps open flame from the skybridges, Veya and the Wardens destroy the poisoned margin of the map. They preserve the verified routes as shared charts.","location_id":"loc_emberroost","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_maris"],"goal":"Neutralise the hostile command and make the verified routes public.","conflict":"Veya is tempted to keep the original map as proof of her mentor's theory, but the command still pulls at anyone who reads it.","outcome":"The poisoned margin is burned safely, the true routes are copied for all isles, and Veya accepts that shared truth outweighs personal recognition.","depends_on":["scn_the_cost_of_control"]},{"id":"scn_a_season_of_wind_debt","title":"A Season of Wind-Debt","summary":"At Mistral Docks, Kael negotiates a new toll arrangement with the Wardens and lifts the grain levy on The Hollow. Maris returns home with her harvest, and Veya begins charting the next season of drift.","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_kael","chr_veya","chr_maris"],"goal":"Settle the immediate consequences of the crisis and restore trade on the shared routes.","conflict":"Kael's Cartel allies resent the lost monopoly, and old wounds between Maris and the Cartel remain unhealed.","outcome":"A fragile peace takes hold: wind-debts are eased, the Hollow is fed, and Veya's shared charts keep the isles connected, though the eerie map's origin remains unexplained.","depends_on":["scn_burning_the_margin"]}]}]}
